1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Module review · Start Here: Your Founder Journey
Recap: Start Here

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Before you move on, read your founding profile and health check together.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:25.911
You have seen the whole journey, written a factual profile of what you are building and recorded an honest starting point for each foundation, ready to compare at the end.

4
00:00:26.311 --> 00:00:26.911
One lesson at a time

5
00:00:26.911 --> 00:00:36.659
0.1 How this course works: The course follows the natural order of founding decisions: each module builds on what you decided before.

6
00:00:36.659 --> 00:00:46.037
0.2 Your founding profile: A founding profile is one page of plain facts, with open questions marked honestly rather than guessed.

7
00:00:46.037 --> 00:00:57.896
0.3 Baseline health check of your foundations: A health check is not a test: it makes your starting point visible so you can choose priorities.

8
00:00:58.496 --> 00:01:09.615
Clarify comes next: you turn your profile into purpose, vision, mission and first priorities, and start on the areas your health check flagged.

9
00:01:10.215 --> 00:01:15.015
You check your starting point and download each exercise as a PDF.

10
00:01:16.515 --> 00:01:19.615
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
